[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0004","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0007","title":"NetScreen Firewall WebUI 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetScreen 防火墙 WebUI 管理界面存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Web 管理接口发送超长 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致防火墙服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ScreenOS 1.73 及 2.x 系列版本，利用方式简单，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，严重威胁网络边界安全设备的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0007"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28.713","remediation":"升级 ScreenOS 至 3.0 及以上版本以修复 WebUI 缓冲区溢出漏洞。同时，在防火墙策略中限制 WebUI 管理界面的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信管理网段访问（默认端口 80/443），避免将管理接口暴露在公网。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上配置访问控制列表（ACL）拦截对管理接口的异常长 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1707","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155149","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2176","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5908","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20532","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0007","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0007.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qm34-w9p4-fxqv/GHSA-qm34-w9p4-fxqv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6645d3fc-76b8-4a3a-b760-ae1dee778077.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0097","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0097","title":"Infinite Interchange 3.6.1 Web界面拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Infinite Interchange 3.6.1的Web接口存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份验证即可通过发送超大的POST请求导致应用程序崩溃，造成服务不可用。攻击复杂度低，影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0097"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"Infinite Interchange 3.6.1已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件。若无法替换，可在前端反向代理或Web服务器层面限制POST请求体大小以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T16:52:57.205566995+00:00","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2140","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152403","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5798"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0038","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0093","title":"BSD TelnetD 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"BSD 系统的 TelnetD 服务存在远程命令执行漏洞，由于 telnetd 对环境变量处理不当，攻击者可通过向目标系统的 telnet 端口发送特制的恶意请求，利用 telnet 协议中的选项协商机制触发漏洞，从而在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响多个 BSD 衍生系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0093"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12","updated":"2001-02-12","remediation":"立即应用 NetBSD SA2000-017 或对应 FreeBSD 补丁更新 telnetd 版本；在 inetd.conf 中注释 telnet 行（`telnet stream tcp nowait root /usr/libexec/telnetd telnetd -a`）并重启 inetd 服务以禁用 telnetd；改用 SSH 作为远程登录替代方案；限制本地非授权用户对系统的交互式访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/409","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0093","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0093.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0093.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xrwm-3443-592w/GHSA-xrwm-3443-592w.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88534/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0093.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0034","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0082","title":"Check Point Software FireWall-1 Fast Mode TCP 碎片绕过限制漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 SP2 的 Fast Mode 功能存在访问限制绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标防火墙发送特制的畸形 TCP 分片数据包，可绕过防火墙规则过滤，将恶意流量穿透至受保护的内网。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 4.1 SP2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商建议禁用 Fast Mode 功能或升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0082"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级至 Check Point Firewall-1 下一代版本（如 NG FP1 及以上），或禁用 Fast Mode 功能（在 Security Policy → Properties 中取消勾选 Accept Fast Mode）。对于无法升级的环境，可在网络边界设备上配置碎片重组策略，丢弃非法的微小 TCP 分片包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0271.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20519","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2001-0082"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0011","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0024","title":"Leif M. Wright simplestmail.cgi 1.0 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"simplestmail.cgi 1.0 存在远程命令执行漏洞，由于程序未对用户提交的输入进行充分过滤和验证，远程攻击者可通过向 CGI 脚本发送特制请求参数触发漏洞，在目标服务器上以 Web 服务器权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Leif M. Wright 开发的 simplestmail.cgi 1.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致服务器被完全控制或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0024"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12","updated":"2001-02-12","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 simplestmail.cgi 脚本，该脚本已停止维护且无安全更新。替代方案：使用主流邮件表单处理脚本（如 PHP mail 函数封装）替代，并在 Web 服务器层面对上传目录禁用执行权限，对用户输入做严格的参数过滤。可在 Apache 中通过 ModSecurity 规则阻止 cmd 等危险参数传递。如必须继续使用，在脚本入口处添加输入验证逻辑，过滤 shell 元字符（;、|、`、$ 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0024","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0024.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8vx4-2r25-7xmp/GHSA-8vx4-2r25-7xmp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2102/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0011.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0011.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0006","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0009","title":"Lotus Domino Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino Server 5.0.x 版本 Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标服务器发送包含 `..` 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，突破路径限制，读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等）。该漏洞影响 Domino Server 5.0.2、5.0.3 及 5.0.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，是典型的 Web 路径遍历漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0009"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Lotus Domino Server 至 5.0.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中禁用对 ../ 路径序列的解析，并限制 Web 服务进程对文件系统的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1703","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/154537","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155124","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2173","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5899","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20530"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0003","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0006","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 网络互斥体拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 系统的 Winsock2ProtocolCatalogMutex 互斥体存在不安全的默认权限配置漏洞（CWE-732），该互斥体被设置为 Everyone 组拥有完全控制权限，导致本地攻击者可将互斥体访问权限修改为\"No Access\"，从而禁用 Winsock 网络协议栈，使系统无法建立任何网络连接，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 全版本，攻击者需具备本地登录权限即可利用，无需交互。Microsoft 已于安全公告 MS01-003 中发布修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0006"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12","updated":"2001-02-12","remediation":"安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a（SP6a）及之后发布的安全更新汇总包，该补丁修复了 Networking Mutex 中的竞争条件导致系统蓝屏崩溃的问题。对于已停止支持的旧系统，建议升级至更高版本 Windows（如 Windows Server 2003/2008）以获取持续安全支持。如无法升级，限制不可信用户对受影响主机的网络访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0006","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0006.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms01-003.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cgm8-c3pr-78fr/GHSA-cgm8-c3pr-78fr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/SSVC/data/2001/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0392","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1274","title":"MySQL 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MySQL数据库在3.23.31及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标MySQL服务发送特制的网络请求触发该溢出，导致数据库服务崩溃拒绝服务，并在特定攻击条件下可能获取系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响MySQL 3.22.x和3.23.x等多个早期版本，CVSS评分7.5。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1274"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56.693","remediation":"立即升级 MySQL 至 3.23.31 或更高版本以修复该缓冲区溢出漏洞。Debian 用户安装 DSA-013 补丁包，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2001:003 补丁包，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-014 补丁包。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙中限制 3306 端口仅对可信网络开放，并在 MySQL 配置文件中设置 skip-networking 或 bind-address = 127.0.0.1 禁止外部连接，同时使用带权限的用户账号连接数据库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000375","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98089552030459&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-006.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-013","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-014.php3","http://www.mysql.com/documentation/mysql/bychapter/manual_News.html#News-3.23.3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-003.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1274.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1274","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1274.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1274.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-013.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4pvx-qg9w-9qv5/GHSA-4pvx-qg9w-9qv5.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1274.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1274.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mysql_3_23_31.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86999/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0392.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0392.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0394","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1275","title":"MySQL 数据库 特权提升漏洞","description":"MySQL数据库在3.23.31版本之前存在特权提升漏洞，已有MySQL账户的用户可通过执行SHOW GRANTS命令，从mysql.user表中获取加密的管理员密码，随后通过密码破解手段获取更高权限。该漏洞影响MySQL 3.23.31之前的所有版本，攻击条件为攻击者需先拥有MySQL账户登录权限，利用方式为通过SHOW GRANTS命令提取密码哈希并进行破解以提升权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1275"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56.843","remediation":"将 MySQL 升级至 3.23.31 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SHOW GRANTS 命令泄露 mysql.user 表中加密管理员密码的问题。同时建议限制普通用户对 mysql.user 表的直接访问权限，移除不必要用户的 SHOW GRANTS 授权，并定期轮换数据库管理员密码以降低密码被破解的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98089552030459&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-006.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-014.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-003.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b2be8fd4334c936c67f124199efee5b6ef5d0a06/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1275.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1275","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c671d2fb006282d170beae8bd280660988f3dd1d/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1275.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4190a549751bffc11b00246a033a062f4109e196/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1275.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jr9h-ffpv-wrqm/GHSA-jr9h-ffpv-wrqm.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1275.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mysql_flaws.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88032/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1275.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0002","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1473","title":"SSH SSH-1协议私钥计算漏洞","description":"SSH-1 协议在会话密钥协商过程中存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过中间人攻击方式伪造与目标服务器相同的 Session ID，同时使用弱公钥对替换合法公钥，从而计算出对应的私钥。攻击者利用已破解的密钥对即可劫持会话并伪装成目标服务器，实现对加密通信的窃听与篡改。该漏洞影响所有使用 SSH-1 协议的系统与客户端，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 SSH-2 协议以彻底规避此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1473"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2001-01-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:20.683","remediation":"禁用 SSH-1 协议，仅使用 SSH-2。检查服务器 OpenSSH 配置（/etc/ssh/sshd_config），将 Protocol 设置为 2，并重启 sshd 服务。客户端也需禁用 SSH-1 兼容模式（Protocol 2）。对于老旧系统无法升级 OpenSSH 的，建议升级到支持 SSH-2 的版本（如 OpenSSH 3.4p1 及以上）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/684820","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6603","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2001/CVE-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2001/CVE-2001-1473.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d5838f491a2d04e9f823fb9638e9e6f0b038d399/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1473.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2001/CVE-2001-1473.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2001-1473_1.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2001/CVE-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2001-1473_4.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2001-1473-1299.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/b504c563e52b82e368fb82bf2033317b7c351e61/tracker/CVE/2001/CVE-2001-1473.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2001-1473-1300.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0250","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0590","title":"Apache Tomcat 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat Servlet 3.2.2 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可发送不带 HTTP 协议规范（如 HTTP/1.0）的畸形 URL 请求，绕过安全限制读取任意 JSP 文件源代码，导致敏感源代码泄露。影响 Apache Tomcat Servlet 3.2.2 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。攻击条件为发送不以 HTTP/1.0 或 HTTP/1.1 结尾的畸形 HTTP 请求，服务器解析异常导致返回 JSP 源码而非执行结果。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0590"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-01","updated":"2001-01-01","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T02:00:18.779396885+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0250.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0250.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0289","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0289.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0679","title":"趋势科技 InterScan VirusWall HELO 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"这是一个影响趋势科技 Interscan VirusWall 3.2.3/3.3 版本的安全漏洞。路由器上的 HTTP 服务器在处理来自远程攻击者发送的特制长 HELO 命令时会出现缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码被执行。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络远程触发此漏洞，实现完整的系统控制。漏洞影响具体产品为 Interscan VirusWall 3.2.3/3.3 版本和可能包括 3.23 版本。攻击条件非常宽松，攻击方式简单，攻击者只需向目标服务器发送一个包含超长 HELO 命令的网络数据包即可触发溢出。在成功的利用中，攻击者可以劫持整个服务器进程，实现远程代码执行（CVE 评分为 10.0 是最高的严重性）。由于存在无限循环写入和可疑的文件系统操作，导致应用程序崩溃和拒绝服务风险很高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0679"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-11-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:45.400","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.6 或更高版本以获取官方安全补丁，或直接停用该过时产品；若暂时无法升级，请在防火墙配置规则阻断外部对默认 SMTP 端口 25 的访问，并将服务绑定至本地回环地址限制仅本地访问以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94204166130782&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94208143007829&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94216491202063&w=2","http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9911&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R2331","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3465","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19614"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0289.toml"}]